  "body": "Stability test build for local PS4 PKG installation.\n\nChanges:\n- keeps BGFT state alive while the PS4 consumes the downloaded PKG\n- starts the PS4 install task immediately after download and verification\n- shows download percentage and transfer speed\n- shows PS4 installation percentage when reported by BGFT\n- retains the downloaded PKG after installation for this stability build\n- records the last installation stage in /data/OrbisShelf/install_stage.txt\n\nUse only with PKGs you created or are authorized to redistribute."
